# ---- THE REGISTER FILE: the footer at 12:1's declaration REMOVED — its block (Deut 12:1, Deut 28:69] holds law_seducers given_at Deut 13:1: the class DAEMONS (GREEN — a declared green is STALE by the gate's own rule); 10b's why stood until this compile ----
path = f"{ROOT}/World/step9/register_dispositions.yaml"
